---
import ContentLayout from '@/layouts/ContentLayout.astro';
---

<ContentLayout section="help" title="Shipping" heading="Shipping" lead="Every piece is printed to order, then shipped with tracking to the US and UK." updated="5 October 2026">
  <h2>How long it takes</h2>
  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>Destination</th><th>Printing</th><th>Standard</th><th>Express</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>United States</td><td>2–5 working days</td><td>3–6 working days</td><td>2–3 working days</td></tr>
      <tr><td>United Kingdom</td><td>2–5 working days</td><td>2–4 working days</td><td>1–2 working days</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <p>Checkout shows an estimated delivery date for your address before you pay.</p>
  <h2>What it costs</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>United States: free standard shipping over $60. Otherwise from $5.99. Express from $14.99.</li>
    <li>United Kingdom: free standard shipping over £50. Otherwise from £4.99. Express from £11.99.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>More than one parcel</h2>
  <p>We work with two print partners. If your order has items from both, it arrives in two parcels, each with its own tracking link. You only pay shipping once.</p>
  <h2>Taxes and duties</h2>
  <p>UK prices include VAT. US orders are shipped from US print facilities, so there are no import duties. Sales tax is shown at checkout where it applies.</p>
  <h2>Tracking</h2>
  <p>You get a tracking link by email as soon as each parcel ships. You can also <a href="/track-order">track your order here</a>.</p>
</ContentLayout>
